BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  In the beginning, there was only the golden seed of Aethel, held in the palm of the First Trav) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    eler. To hold it was safety, but to hold it was also stagnation. The Traveler met the Earth-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    Spirit at the crossroads of the void. "If I plant this in your garden," the Traveler asked, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    "what shall come of it?" The Earth-Spirit smiled, for she held the power of the triad-the ma) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    gic that triples the fruit of any offering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  "If you keep the seed, you keep the hunger," the Spirit whispered. "But if you cast it into my) Tj ET
