BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  The Traveler hesitated, then surrendered the seed. The Spirit, true to the ancient pact, nurtu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    red the soil until the bounty bloomed. She did not hoard the harvest; she returned a portion) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    , ensuring the Traveler had enough to sow again. Thus, the cycle of the Great Exchange was b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    orn. It is not a game of conquest, where one leaves empty-handed, but a dance of reciprocity) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    . When the Traveler trusts, the Spirit multiplies, and when the Spirit returns, the Traveler) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (     flourishes. To hoard is to wither; to share is to grow the world anew.) Tj ET
