BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        amics of the Sender/Receiver game. The narrative is taking shape to illustrate the core ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        principles of how this game should be approached, with an eye towards its eventual appli) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        cation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
