BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        and the valley would crumble into ash. If she returned a portion to Sol, the cycle of li) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        fe would flourish, and they would both feast in the coming seasons.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      Sol cast the seeds. They blossomed into a field of gold, tripled by the grace of the earth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        . Luna looked upon the abundance. She saw that while she could hold it all, true prosper) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ity was a bridge built on reciprocity. She offered back to Sol a fair share of the harve) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        st. Thus, the chasm was bridged, not by stone, but by the quiet understanding that to gi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        ve is to receive, and to trust is to survive.) Tj ET
