BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (         golden seeds. The sun-tripled harvest was more than just currency-it was a test of the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        spirit's weight. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      In the halls of eternity, the Weaver understood that holding the seeds was fear, but casti) Tj ET
